DOKODEMO-Pro is a shopping mall that focuses on discovering Japanese goods;
 the platform has many Japanese brands, more than 400 original products, 
100% authentic guarantee, take you to experience the exquisite life of Japan.

Download the app and try the quick meals and other good stuff we have prepared for you.

How it works?

Download the app before you visit Pingo Doce & GO NOVA;
Tilt your phone to tags (NFC) or use the camera to add items to your cart;
When you finish paying in the app to avoid queues and receive your bill immediately;
Buy anytime in GO closet 24/7.


This app works only on Pingo Doce & GO NEW (@ NEW SBE - School of Business and Economics).
